; THE DUNGEON RIFT TEST (sl-0180 wave 2): the designer's shape — a
; path walked like a path, mobs scattered along it, a boss at the
; end. Void galaxy skin; the DUNGEON line (slow clock, no deep
; edge); pack spacing script-verified >12 (min 12.2 — the Warren
; law). The end boss = the pool's decel_wall: its kill LANDS THE
; CATCH and the dive ends won (the phased-only gate makes mob
; deaths safe). TEST ACCESS: the dev console command `dungeon`
; jumps here; the picker lists it like every scenario; ambient
; dungeon-rift spawns wire later behind [T] once this proves.

